oyment.</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"proof-cell\">\n                <div class=\"proof-kicker\">3 pilot sites</div>\n                <div class=\"proof-detail\">Enough real-world environments to show the rollout motion can be repeated.</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"proof-cell\">\n                <div class=\"proof-kicker\">18–20 months</div>\n                <div class=\"proof-detail\">Runway to execute the proof plan, measure outcomes, and package the next round case.</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"right-pane\">\n          <div class=\"stats-row\">\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <div class=\"stat-num\">2</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-lbl\">key hires</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <div class=\"stat-num\">3</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-lbl\">pilot sites</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat\">\n              <div class=\"stat-num\">18–20</div>\n              <div class=\"stat-lbl\">months runway</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"unlock-title\">What this round unlocks</div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"m-grid\">\n              <div class=\"stage\">Build</div>\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"m-head\">Pilot-ready deployment foundation</div>\n                <div class=\"m-points\"><strong>Founding engineer in place;</strong> clinician-grade product loop live.</div>\n                <div class=\"m-tags\">\n                  <div class=\"tag\">implementation + customer success hire</div>\n                  <div class=\"tag\">pilot onboarding workflows</div>\n                  <div class=\"tag\">site-specific deployment readiness</div>\n                  <div class=\"tag\">reporting and operational instrumentation</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"m-side\">Complete the minimum product and workflow layer required to go live reliably.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"m-grid\">\n              <div class=\"stage\">Deploy</div>\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"m-head\">Launch 3 pilot sites</div>\n                <div class=\"m-points\"><strong>Implementation / ops lead in place;</strong> pilot sites launched with a repeatable rollout motion.</div>\n                <div class=\"m-tags\">\n                  <div class=\"tag\">live pilot implementations</div>\n                  <div class=\"tag\">provider and staff onboarding</div>\n                  <div class=\"tag\">site feedback loop into product</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"m-side\">Demonstrate that Designer can be implemented and used in real visit environments.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"milestone\">\n            <div class=\"m-grid\">\n              <div class=\"stage\">Validate</div>\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"m-head\">Prove value and repeatability</div>\n                <div class=\"m-points\"><strong>Measurable pilot outcomes;</strong> seed-ready proof package.</div>\n                <div class=\"m-tags\">\n                  <div class=\"tag\">usage and workflow adoption signals</div>\n                  <div class=\"tag\">time / operational value metrics</div>\n                  <div class=\"tag\">referenceable pilot outcomes</div>\n                  <div class=\"tag\">clear next-round proof points</div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"m-side\">Generate the evidence needed to move from first pilots to a repeatable deployment motion.</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"bottom-ribbon\">\n          <div class=\"ribbon-label\">Use